  m_Name: Astronomer Kepler
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Astronomer Kepler
  offerText: I beg you, let me set up my massive brass telescope by your window for
    just one night! I cannot pay you yet, but the cosmic discovery will be legendary.
  acceptResultText: The massive telescope blocks your entire window, and you constantly
    trip over its heavy tripod. You feel incredibly foolish for allowing this junk
    into your home.
  rejectResultText: You kick the frantic stargazer out. You enjoy your personal space,
    completely free of ridiculous metal tubes.
  acceptedDelayedText: Kepler returns ecstatic! He discovered a new comet, won a
    royal grant, and hands you a massive share of the prize money!
  rejectedDelayedText: 
